# 40K Core quotes (WarCom-free)

Cite [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) Sec 10. **AGENTS.md wins.**

## Allowed

Under `games/warhammer_40k_11e/rules/` and `games/warhammer_40k_11e/setup/` only: verbatim quotes from WarCom-**free** system PDFs and local `C:\Personal\40K\rules\eng_*` copies.

Every quote block: **filename + page + rule ID** (e.g. `VISIBILITY — 06.01`).

## Hierarchy

- Core Rules PDF (`eng_01-06_*`) = baseline.
- Dated `eng_*` universal updates / Event Companion supersede on the same topic. Omission is not a patch.

**Codex wall:** never quote Codex / Faction Pack / paid army rules here.

House line: Warhammer 40,000 is Copyright Games Workshop Limited.

## Print / export

- Army teaching pages and print HTML: paraphrase + [`gw-unofficial-footer`](gw-unofficial-footer.mdc).
- Quote appendix markdown stays in-repo; do not export as event PDF unless owner gates.
